msgid "Import product lists with clearer feedback on invalid rows."
msgstr "Import product lists with clearer feedback on invalid rows."

#: src/price_tracker/release_notes.py:28
msgid "Browse products by page and filter active, paused or failing items."
msgstr "Browse products by page and filter active, paused or failing items."

#: src/price_tracker/release_notes.py:29
msgid "Sold-out listings no longer trigger misleading price alerts."
msgstr "Sold-out listings no longer trigger misleading price alerts."

